[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:29. Come In, Amy]
[00:00.580]Lesson 29. | 第29课。
[00:02.830]Come in, Bessie. | 进来，贝西。
[00:06.295]Shut the door, please. | 请关上门。
[00:10.360]This bedroom's very untidy. | 这卧室很凌乱。
[00:14.455]What must I do, Mrs. Jones? | 琼斯夫人，我该做什么？
[00:17.860]Open the window and air the room. | 打开窗户，让房间通风。
[00:22.710]Then put these clothes in the wardrobe. | 然后把这些衣服放进衣柜。
[00:27.480]Then make the bed. | 然后铺床。
[00:30.680]Dust the dressing table. | 掸掉梳妆台的灰尘。
[00:34.165]Then sweep the floor. | 然后扫地。